# Journey stage 1 (First Shift) on a desktop: the briefing, the countdown,
# shelves restocked and guests served by clicking the market, to the
# results with the First Shift achievement, then Next into stage 2.
# viewport 1280x720@1
until 300 All modes
frames 10
click =All modes
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Journey
until 60 Journey stages
frames 10
save journey
click =First Shift
until 60 Start shift
frames 10
click =Start shift
until 60 3
save countdown
until 300 Checkout 1
frames 5
repeat 6000 until Shift complete
  click =Checkout 1
  frames 10
  click =Rise & Crumb Bakery — shelf 1
  frames 10
  click =Rise & Crumb Bakery — shelf 2
  frames 10
  click =Rise & Crumb Bakery — shelf 3
  frames 10
  click =Rise & Crumb Bakery — shelf 4
  frames 10
end
frames 60
expect Achievement: First Shift
save results
click Next: Morning Rush
until 300 Checkout 1
frames 60
save stage-2
